    "sentence_translations": [
      "Medicine Effective for 12 Hours",
      "",
      "One day, Paul went to the hospital.",
      "The doctor gave him medicine and told him: “This medicine is effective for 12 hours.”",
      "",
      "Paul nodded, and left smiling.",
      "Paul smiled while walking, and when he returned to the school he was still smiling to no end.",
      "",
      "Little Le noticed that Paul was constantly smiling, felt it strange, and asked:",
      "“Paul, did something good happen? Why are you smiling constantly?”",
      "Paul said: “I'm not happy at all. I just went to the hospital, and what medicine do you think the doctor gave me?”",
      "“I have to smile for 12 hours. I'm really tired from smiling!”",
      "",
      "Little Le laughed out loud, and said: “Paul, stop smiling.”",
      "“The doctor didn't say that you should ‘smile for 12 hours’, but that the ‘medicine is effective for 12 hours’!”"
    ]
